## compare-ui: compare_ui.rs, compare_draw.rs

compare-ui-title = Compare Versions
compare-ui-intro = Shows what changed between two versions, or between a version and the open drawing, on the plan and in 3D. Added objects are green, changed objects are orange, and removed objects are drawn as ghosts where they were. Each kind also has its own line pattern and mark.
compare-ui-no-versions = There are no versions yet. Save a version in File > Versions first.
compare-ui-tab-two = Two sides
compare-ui-tab-history = History
compare-ui-current = Current drawing
compare-ui-pick = Pick a version
compare-ui-from = Old
compare-ui-to = New
compare-ui-swap = Swap
compare-ui-same-side = Pick two different sides.
compare-ui-branch = Branch
compare-ui-mode-neighbours = Each step against the step before
compare-ui-mode-base = Each step against one base
compare-ui-base = Base
compare-ui-slider-empty = There are not enough versions to step through.
compare-ui-newer = Newer
compare-ui-older = Older
compare-ui-newest = newest
compare-ui-oldest = oldest
compare-ui-step = Step { $step } of { $total }
compare-ui-pair = { $from } to { $to }
compare-ui-show-on-drawing = Show on the drawing
compare-ui-unchanged = Unchanged objects
compare-ui-unchanged-show = Show
compare-ui-unchanged-dim = Dim
compare-ui-unchanged-hide = Hide
compare-ui-palette = Colors
compare-ui-palette-standard = Green, red, orange
compare-ui-palette-blind = For color blindness
compare-ui-ghosts = Ghosts of removed objects
compare-ui-previous = Old place of changed objects
compare-ui-pick-two = Pick the old and the new side to compare.
compare-ui-no-changes = The two sides are the same.
compare-ui-legend-added = { $count } added
compare-ui-legend-removed = { $count } removed
compare-ui-legend-changed = { $count } changed
compare-ui-partial = The comparison stopped before the end. The counts are partial.
compare-ui-filter-added = Added
compare-ui-filter-removed = Removed
compare-ui-filter-changed = Changed
compare-ui-click = Click an object to select it and zoom to it. A removed object is framed as a ghost.
compare-ui-more = There are more changes than the list shows.
compare-ui-no-ghost = This removed object is not drawn as a ghost, because there are too many.
compare-ui-gone = This object is not in the drawing that is shown.
compare-ui-sheets = Sheets side by side
compare-ui-no-sheets = The drawing has no sheet layers.
compare-ui-note-ghosts = Ghosts: { $drawn } of { $total } removed objects are drawn.
compare-ui-note-shapes = { $omitted } old shapes are not kept.
compare-ui-note-statuses = { $untracked } changes are only counted, not marked.
